# UI/UX MyTraining

Dark mode estricto. Cero variantes light. Paleta cerrada (preguntar antes de un color nuevo):

| Uso | Clases |
|---|---|
| Fondo | `bg-zinc-950`, `bg-zinc-900/60`, `bg-zinc-900/40` |
| Borde | `border-zinc-800/60`, `border-zinc-800/70` |
| Acento | `text-cyan-400`, `bg-cyan-400`, `text-blue-500` |
| PR | `text-amber-400`, `text-amber-500` |
| Peligro / éxito | `text-red-400` / `text-emerald-400` |
| Texto | `text-zinc-100`, `text-zinc-400`, `text-zinc-500` |

## Patrones

- Card: `rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/60 p-3`
- Primario: `rounded-2xl bg-grad-brand px-4 py-2 text-white shadow-cta`
- Icono: `flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400`
- Botones: tap ≥ 44×44, `active:scale-[0.98]`
- Inputs: `text-base` (16px). Safe area: `pt-[env(safe-area-inset-top)]`, `pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)]`
- Scroll horizontal: `overflow-x-auto -mx-4 px-4`

## A11y e interacciones

- `aria-label` en icon-only, `aria-pressed` en toggles, `aria-expanded`/`aria-controls` en acordeones.
- WCAG AA (4.5:1 / 3:1).
- Confirms: `useConfirm()` de `src/lib/ui/ConfirmProvider.tsx`. Toasts: `useToast()` de `src/lib/ui/ToastProvider.tsx`.
- Prohibido: `alert`, `confirm`, `prompt`, confetti, emojis decorativos (salvo disciplina).
